<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - KU Energy upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KU Energy upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hilliard Lyons analyst David Burks said he upgraded KU Energy Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>--Shares in the electric utility were up 1/8 to 30-1/4.</p>
<p>--Burks said the company is &quot;a high quality electric that possesses favorable fundamentals and an attractive yield.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
